# Debhelper file-list for the "ostserver-complete" binary package - see
# debian/control's own description and cmake/cpack/DebianPackage.cmake's
# Complete-component header comment for the full rationale.
#
# Same binary/libs/service as ostserver.install (dh_install stages an
# independent copy into THIS package too - deliberate duplication, not a
# mistake, see debian/control: Conflicts/Replaces, not Depends) plus the
# frontend's static files. No dev headers (a beginner installing the
# all-in-one package has no use for module headers) and no changelog
# (Debian policy wants it under this package's own name,
# share/doc/ostserver-complete/ - cmake/Frontend.cmake doesn't produce
# that yet, left as a known rough edge rather than solved here).
usr/bin/ostserver
usr/lib/libost*.so*
lib/systemd/system/ostserver.service
var/www/pilost/*
